{"id":"660049","name":"浓醇酸奶雪糕，简单易做，冰凉沁心，清凉一夏。","author":"宅家吃货JACKERLU","authorId":"12121547","desc":"","cover":"images/660049/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"淡奶油","amount":"200克"},{"name":"糖粉","amount":"30克"},{"name":"奶粉","amount":"15克"}],"sub":[{"name":"老酸奶","amount":"200克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"淡奶油200克、糖粉30克、奶粉15克，放一起。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/17/20240717172119397522868312121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"打发至微稠油纹路状。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/17/20240717172119397659277212121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入老酸奶200克。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/17/20240717172119399017378012121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"继续打发均匀至丝滑状。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/17/20240717172119399450929812121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"装入裱花袋。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/17/20240717172119400182859312121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"然后挤入雪糕模具里，或者其他形状的模具。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/17/20240717172119401073915612121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"震几下抹平表面。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/17/20240717172119401770639912121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入冰箱冷冻室，冷冻至少4小时，最好过夜，直到完全凝固。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/17/20240717172119402298428112121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"当雪糕完全凝固后，从模具中取出。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/17/20240717172119402932967412121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"可以直接享用，或者稍微放置几分钟，使雪糕稍微软化，更加细腻。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/17/20240717172119403866241812121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":11,"desc":"浓醇酸奶雪糕，完成O(∩_∩)O","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/17/20240717172119405025581612121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":12,"desc":"入口即化，带来夏日最清凉的甜蜜体验。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/17/20240717172119407183527412121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":13,"desc":"绵密的质感和酸奶独特的酸甜交织在一起，让人欲罢不能。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/17/20240717172119407671222312121547.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"1、如果喜欢带有水果口感的雪糕，可以将喜欢的水果切成小块，加入到酸奶雪糕混合物中，轻轻搅拌均匀。\n2、选择新鲜的酸奶、鲜奶油和牛奶，保证雪糕的口感和健康。\n3、如果是硬质模具，可以稍微用温水浸泡模具外部几秒钟，方便脱模，但不要过久，以免雪糕融化。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：打蛋器\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}